<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n94009" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σῐδήρ-ιον</span></b>  (
			Dor.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σιδάριον</span></b> 
		<i><span class="en">
			<u>Schwyzer</u>
			180.5
		</span></i> (<span class="entity">Crete</span>)), τό,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>implement</i> or <i>tool
				of iron,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				12.313.128
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(v B.C.)</span>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θερμοῖσι ς. ἐκκαίειν
				τοὺς ὀφθαλμούς</span>
			<i>with</i> hot <i>irons</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				7.18
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπαΐοντες σιδηρίων</span>
			feeling <i>iron</i>, not being proof against it, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				3.29
			</span></i>; of a <i>knife</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				9.37
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				1.42
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. εἰς κρεονομίαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PCair.Zen.</u>
					720.3
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς.
			λιθουργά</span>, of a stonemason's <i>tools</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				4.4
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Lap.</u>
				41
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σιδηρίων μισθός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					22.1656
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λίθους καὶ ξύλα καὶ ς.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Euthd.</u>
					300b
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. πλατέα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Cael.</u>
					313a17
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>iron</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Daimachus
				4J.
			</span></i> (
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σίδηρον</span>
			).</div>
